#. translators: card header for Easter calculation tool
#: index.php:170 usage.php:298
msgid "Calculation of the Dates of Easter"
msgstr "Izračun datuma Uskrsa"

#: index.php:175
msgid ""
"A simple API endpoint that returns data about the Dates of Easter, both "
"Gregorian and Julian, from 1583 (year of the adoption of the Gregorian "
"Calendar) to 9999 (maximum possible date calculation in 64bit PHP), using a "
"PHP adaptation of the Meeus/Jones/Butcher algorithm for Gregorian easter "
"(observed by the Roman Catholic church) and of the Meeus algorithm for "
"Julian easter (observed by orthodox churches)."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavna API krajnja točka koja vraća podatke o datumima Uskrsa, kako "
"gregorijanskom tako i julijanskom, od 1583. (godina usvajanja gregorijanskog "
"kalendara) do 9999. (maksimalni mogući izračun datuma u 64bitnom PHP-u), "
"koristeći PHP prilagodbu Meeus/Jones/Butcher algoritma za gregorijanski "
"Uskrs (kojeg slavi Rimokatolička crkva) i Meeusov algoritam za julijanski "
"Uskrs (kojeg slave pravoslavne crkve)."

#: index.php:180
msgid "Dates of Easter API endpoint"
msgstr "API krajnja točka za datume Uskrsa"

#: index.php:182
msgid ""
"Currently the data can be requested with almost any localization. In any "
"case, since the API returns a UNIX timestamp for each date of Easter, "
"localizations can be done in a client application just as well."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno se podaci mogu tražiti s gotovo bilo kojom lokalizacijom. U svakom "
"slučaju, budući da API vraća UNIX vremenski žig za svaki datum Uskrsa, "
"lokalizacije se mogu izvršiti jednako dobro u klijentskoj aplikaciji."

